  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "49",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 49"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jawanyana kaAmoni. Yehova neliuli nindi, Isarela hakweti anyana amayalaku, tahindi? Hakweti nswanaku, tahindi? Ndochu Malikami naswaninidi mpata yaGadi? Niantu indi anashakaminidi munyikala yayu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, kudi nakwinza mafuku inakatiyakeshela Raba wawanyana kaAmoni kabobobu kanjita; wakabalumuka mulumba wamukunkulwayi, anyanindi awambanda akayocha nakesi. Henaha aIsarela akaswana asweni wena. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Heshiboni, kalukaku, muloŋa Ayi anamupupi dehi. Enu anyana kaRaba awambanda, bilelenu, vwalenu yikeleyi. Dilenu, temukenu niniku niniku mukachi kayipaka; muloŋa Malikami wakaya muwukoli, niatupristu twindi niatulamba twindi kumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana wamumbanda waselumukilaŋa hanyima, wudi nakudisaminadi nayinekineki yeyi? Chinekineki cheyi chinahiti dehi, eyi muntu wakuhweleleli yuma yeyi yalema, neyi kudami kwakenzanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Tiya, nakakuletela woma wakufuma kudi antu ejima akunyeŋumuka niniku niniku. Enu akayitemuna wejima wenu chachikupu, hikwakamwekana muntu wakupompesha akwakukimbokaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, nkumininaku nakafuntisha cheŋi anyana kaAmoni ayili muwukoli. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "JaEdomi. Yehova wamazaza neliuli nindi, MuTemani himudi nawa cheŋi maanaku, tahindi? Kudi akwakudihoŋesha mumuchima jinayikaŋi dehi jakushakama hampùŋa, tahindi? Maana awu anayifumi dehi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwashakama muDedani, temukenu, funtenu hanyima, iŋilenu mwakunama mushakamumu, muloŋa ami nakamuletela Esawu kukala, yoyi mpinji yinakamuhempula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudeyi neyi kwenza akwakukumuna nyikabu yavinyu, hiyadi kushila akwawu nyikabuku? Neyi kwenza amakombi nawufuku hiyadi kwila kisaŋane-e nichiyadi kuwaninawuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mi namuvúuli Esawu, namubutululi hawusonyi windi, hakatwesha kubatamaku. Anyanindi avikisaŋana dehi, niana kwindi, niakwawu atuŋayi nawu, niyomwenindi hadi kwoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyaneyi anshona yishiyi, nukuyihemba akahandi. Niantulu wajeyi awambanda ankuhwelelami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiya, antu abulili kufuukwilawu kunwa mulupasa, chiŋa akanwamu hohu chalala, indi eyi yeyi wakashalahu kubula kukubabesha, tahindi? Hiwakashalahu kubula kukubabeshaku, wakanwamu hohu chalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nadisanyiki dehi ami aweni, nami, Bozira wakekala wakuhayamewa, wasawuka, kwachihembi, niishiŋu. Nyikala yawu yejima yakekala kwayihembi yahaya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natiyi nsaŋu jakudi Yehova, anatemeshi kaŋanda munyuza, nawu, Dipompeshenu hamu mwinzi nakulwa nindi, munyamukilinjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tiya, nakukeheshi dehi mukachi kanyuza, wikali wadiwulewa mukachi kawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi washakama munyaji yamwilola, wadikaŋila kwiwulu dampidi, atiyawu woma kudi akwenu, wanta wadinka mumuchima weyi wunakudimbi. Hela wakaala chaala cheyi hewulu dadeni neyi mbuulu nakakuhololahu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edomi wakekala wakuhayamewa. Antu ejima akahitaŋaku akahayama, akayiŋila nansaŋu jayi pupu yawu yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Chakisagenuwu Sodoma naGomora ninyikala yatuŋili kwakwihi nawena, dichi kwosi muntu wakushakamamu nehi, dichi himwakazonkama hela mwana kamuntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, wakakandukila kuwushakaminu wakola neyi chakandukaŋayi mutupa mwitu daYodana; ilaŋa ami nakamukasumwisha, nakamutemuna akafumi kudi yena. Muntu atondawu diyi nakakunjika kwikala mwanta wawu. Ochu wudi neyi ami hinyi? Wakanholokela muchota hinyi? Kabiŋanyi wakemana kumesu ami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi tiyenu mpupa yaYehova yanakwatiliyi Edomi, niyuma yanafuukwiliyi ashakama muTemani, nindi, Chalala akayitulumona nakuyitwala, wowu anyanya ahamukanka wanyikoku. Chalala wakabalumuna hawushakaminu wawu hekali kwayihembi nawena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseki hidikukanka nalushindu lwakudimbokawu. Kudi mbila, yinatiyakani nikuKaluŋalwiji Kachinana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, wakenza chakutúuka neyi mbuulu, wakatanjikila Bozira mpuula jindi; ninyichima yawayilobu amuEdomi denodu ifuku yakekala neyi muchima wamumbanda natiyi nyisoŋu yakuvwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "JaDamakasa. Hamati natiyi nsonyi, niAripadi nawa. Muloŋa anatiyi nsaŋu jatama, hiyakunowa nikunowa. Adi nakululuta neyi kaluŋalwiji kabulapa kumwena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damakasa nazeyi dehi, hakubalumuka nindi atemuki, kuzaala kunamuwani dehi. Niyikatu niyihuŋu yinamuwani dehi, neyi chamonaŋayi mumbanda wudi nakuvwala mwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukala washimekelaŋawu, mukala wunadipi nakuzapalela, o chanawulekuwu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi anyikwenzi jindi akadimbukila munyikwakwa yindi, niamayala akwanjita ejima akayimwenesha denodu ifuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakabutula kesi mumpwembu yaDamakasa, kakalasha matala aBenihadadi awanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "JaKedari, nŋama wanta amuHazori, mpata yatapiluwu kudi Nebukaneza mwanta wakuBabiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
