          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nahoshi nindi, Nyamukenu muyi kuKedari, mupupi antu akumusela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimatenti awu ninyikanka yawu yanyikoku akatwala. Akasenda nimahinawu akukudeka, niyuma yawu yejima niaŋgawumeli jawu; akayibidika nawu, Mutentu niniku niniku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Enu mwashakama muHazori, temukenu, yenu nakukimbuka kwakulehi, inilenu mwakunama mushakamumu; muloŋa mwanta wakuBabiloni Nebukaneza nayikwatili mpùŋa, nayifuukwili chuma chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nyamukenu muyi kumuza wabula kumona kukala, washakama chakadi kwakama; hiyakweti kwawu hela yenzelu hela nyikomenuku, ashakama kanka wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Aŋawumeli jawu akayi buwabuwa, yendu yaŋombi jawu akayipupa. Antu atewula nsuki jawu mumawombu nakayipalapesha mwahita mpcpela jejima. Nakayiletela kukala kwakufuma kumbadi jawu jejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KuHazori kwakekala kwakushakama nyumbu, mumahembi ahaya nyaka. Kwosi muntu wakashakama kwoku, hela hikwakazonkama hela mwana kamuntuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova dakutena Elami denjili kudi kaprofwetu Yeremiya, hatachikili wanta wamwanta wawaYuda Zedekiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Nakakotola wuta wamukunji waElami kwatachikili Ŋovu jawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamuletela Elami mpepela jiwana jakufuma kunsa jewulu jiwana, nakayipekumuna mwahita mpepela jejimoju. Hikwakekala muza wakabula kushika antu amuElami akinjikawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, AElami nakayikwatisha chikasa kukanwa kumesu awayilumbu jawu, nikumesu awantu akakeŋa kuyijaha. Nakayiletela katama, yowu kuzuwa kwami kwasweja. Nakayilondesha mpoku yakabali nichinakayinoŋesha to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nakasha itanda dami dawanta muElami, nakajilumunamu nimwanta niatulamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 49:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Mumafuku akukuminina namba kaleta cheŋi antu amuElami ayili muwukoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.49.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.49.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
